                    r2_mix_readout:         `Recurring / non-drop revenue target:`,
                    r2_pct:                 `%`,
                    r2_mix_hint:            `Today the mix is 70% product / 20% wholesale / 10% collaborations — almost all capacity-bound. Recurring streams break the capacity ceiling but only earn brand equity if you don't dilute the signature.`,
                    r2_systematize_label:   `Systematize the design signature so it survives without the founders touching every piece?`,
                    model_capturemix:       `A capture mix — selective licensing, a membership/community model, a designer platform and made-to-order, decoupling revenue from held inventory`,
                    model_moredrops:        `Scale the drops — produce far more of the signature knit and out-sell the copy`,
