                    insight_scalable:       `Scalable & defensible: you captured value from the assets a copyist can't touch — a reshaped, founder-independent model, a knowledge-driven entry mode, and a budget that bought compounding capability. The tranche unlocked and the runway holds.`,
                    insight_diluted:        `Brand sold out: licensing the signature too broadly or chasing the copyable product spent the very brand equity that made the company worth backing. Cash today, eroded defensibility tomorrow — the 140k community noticed.`,
